main   | loopback out-of-range   | 502   <- 1e9,1e9 was forwarded to terrain.reearth.land
main   | loopback valid          | 200 {"results":[...]}
fixed  | cross-site <img>        | 403 {"error":"Cross-site requests are not accepted"}
fixed  | loopback out-of-range   | 400   <- rejected locally, no upstream call
